--- REPLACED handleCreateInvoice → two-phase flow ---
Phase 1: requestMintQuoteWithUnit → get invoice → display QR → start polling
Phase 2: completeMintAfterPayment (when quote state = PAID):
  - fetchAndCacheKeysets → get keyset ID
  - decomposeAmount → create outputs
  - blindMessage + deterministicBlindingFactor → blinded outputs
  - mintTokens(POST /v1/mint/bolt11) → blind signatures
  - unblindSignature → proofs
  - addProofs → store in IndexedDB
  - updateBalanceDisplay → refresh balance

--- REPLACED startPollingSimulation with startQuotePolling ---
+ Real polling: checks getMintQuoteState every 3s
+ Max 60 polls (~3 minutes) then timeout
+ Handles UNPAID, PAID/ISSUED, EXPIRED states

--- UPDATED resetLightning ---
+ Cleans up pollTimer
+ Resets pendingQuoteId, pendingAmount

